div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"Local IT support"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Support that keeps London businesses running"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Our IT support covers the continuous maintenance and management of your users, hardware and infrastructure, so your business keeps running smoothly even when technical issues arise, as they inevitably do."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"From simple tasks like password resets and new user setup through to complex challenges like resolving security issues, we follow the ITIL continual improvement model, use cutting-edge technology, respond fast and fix things properly, first time."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Most London issues are resolved remotely by our UK service desk. When something needs hands on hardware, an engineer travels to you across Central London and the surrounding boroughs."},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Remote first, onsite when it needs hands"},{"k":"i6","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<picture>\n      <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-480.avif 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-768.avif 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1024.avif 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-480.webp 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-768.webp 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.webp\" alt=\"IT support engineer wearing a headset taking a customer call\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </picture>","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.webp"}},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Heading 2","default":"Remote IT Support London"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"Our technicians securely access your systems from anywhere to resolve issues quickly, from software errors and application updates to security alerts and connectivity problems. No waiting for a visit, minimal disruption and constant access to expert help."},{"k":"i9","type":"i","label":"Image 2","default":{"html":"<picture>\n      <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-480.avif 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-768.avif 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1024.avif 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-480.webp 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-768.webp 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.webp\" alt=\"Branded WhizzIT van parked outside the office\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </picture>","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.webp"}},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Heading 3","default":"Onsite IT Support London"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"Hands-on help at your premises for anything that needs physical attention, hardware maintenance, system upgrades, network setup and infrastructure management. With engineers in Central London, we’re nearby when you need someone in the room."}]}